jobs.description:
Summary of Role
V-Key is an internationally acclaimed software-based digital security company headquartered in Singapore and founded in 2011. Its pioneering mobile technology powers ultra-high-security solutions for digital identity, authentication, authorization for major banks, payment gateways, and government agencies.
We are also the inventor of V-OS, the world’s first and only true patented virtual secure element that uses advanced cryptographic and cybersecurity protections to comply with standards previously reserved only for expensive hardware solutions. It supports a wide range of use cases, including digital banking, national digital identity, digital tokens, Smart Nation, Card- less ATM withdrawals, and Mobile Document Signing.
We are looking for an intern (Quality Assurance) as part of Engineering Department.
Duties and Responsibilities
Learn product knowledge to keep abreast of the latest development of the products;
Get involved in design and document for test procedures, test cases and scripts under QA Lead’s guidance;
Get involved in the automation test activities of the team to improve the quality of product;
Communicate status of testing efforts to QA lead on regular basis.
Requirements
Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems or related field;
English skills are required;
Knowledge with web development;
Have programming skill at any language is a Big Plus;
Familiar with command-line tools;
Passionate about software product testing;
Knowledge in testing methodology advantageous;
Good organizational, communication, interpersonal and ownership skills;
A strong self-starter and adaptation;
Ability to work in a dynamic, fast moving and growing environment;
Critical thinker and problem-solving skills;
Team player with great interpersonal and communication skills.

